，那我们想办法让它均匀起来不就...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:4:1423164003:1":{"key":"say:4:1423164003:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"4","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1423164003","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"我昨天翻了帝国时期魔钢研究的记录，又检查了半天注入了魔...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:5:1423164004:1":{"key":"say:5:1423164004:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"5","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1423164004","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"简单来说，就像水波一样！矿石外层魔力强，内层魔力弱！","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:6:1423164005:0":{"key":"say:6:1423164005:0","kind":"say","source_node_id":"6","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1423164005","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"解决方法你直接看我写的这份研究计划吧！虽然还有些地方不...","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"document:7:236:0":{"key":"document:7:236:0","kind":"document","source_node_id":"7","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"研究目标：\n矿用魔力均质器（暂用名，小漩涡！）\n研究方法：\n研究一种精密的魔法引导器，模拟水波的扩散方式，控制魔力在矿石中的流动与扩散方式！\n通过调整参数，确保魔力在矿石内部能通过特定波动均匀扩散！最终确保魔力在矿石内部均匀地分布，一举解决矿石结构不稳定问题！\n注意：不同矿石适合的波纹频率和幅度参数可能不一致！要调节到合适的波动才能确保均匀！\n天青矿适合的参数计算公式如下：\n（下面是一大堆无法看懂的公式与数字）\n……","textdes_id":"236","document_page_count":"1","document_title_cn":"研究计划（草稿）","document_order":"1","document_object_id":"0","document_item_id":"0","document_icon":"UI/Icon/Item/spui_icon_item_letter.png","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"UI/Prefabs/StoryReadItem/items/pbui_map_story_detail_item3.prefab","document_pic":"","document_gender":"false"},"say:8:1423164006:0":{"key":"say:8:1423164006:0","kind":"say","source_node_id":"8","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1423164006","action_index":"0","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"不错嘛，呼金，不愧是我的好徒弟！","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:9:1423164007:1":{"key":"say:9:1423164007:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"9","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1423164007","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"这才是我们矮人面对问题的态度！","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"say:10:1423164008:1":{"key":"say:10:1423164008:1","kind":"say","source_node_id":"10","source_node_type":"__DT.ActionNode","statementID":"1423164008","action_index":"1","choice_index":"","choice_id":"","source_cn":"可惜，你个年轻人手脚也太慢了，还是晚了一步啊。","textdes_id":"","document_page_count":"","document_title_cn":"","document_order":"","document_object_id":"","document_item_id":"","document_icon":"","document_image_icon":"","document_base_image":"","document_pic":"","document_gender":""},"choice_prompt:11:1423164008":{"key":"choice_prompt:11:1423164008","kind":"choice_prompt","sour